# Validation configuration (--validation): hot MD and 400 GPa snapshots.
# The energies of the 400 GPa ones depend
# on coefficient 26; those at 250 GPa and below, hardly at all. These snapshots
# set coefficient 26, so ta_md_ext_train (other steps of the same MD runs)
# stays unseen for the check after the search.
DBFILE     ../../data/ta_md_ext_val.tadahdb
